report+='## '+fields[2]+'\n\n'+(R/'out/DERIVATION.md').read_text(encoding='utf-8')+'\n\nFirst unsupported UNIVERSAL line: supply an influence-priced ORIGINAL source/cleaned-reference contract for arbitrary indecomposable Boolean cores, or an adequate necessary-policy substitute. The explicit finite block supplier here does not prove that universal line. Requiring this same rate4 contract for every Boolean root would already demand H(G)<=4I(G), a stronger statement than full FEI and not a justified extension.\n\n'
